    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>After leaving his hometown to live with his divorced father, our protagonist returns to his roots for college life. But college is more than just classes\u2014it\u2019s about navigating new experiences, forming lasting relationships, and facing the consequences of choices that will shape his future.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542710/extras/9520cd253a85b0171e32d653be537405.avif?t=1749430914\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campus Bonds</strong> is a slow-burn romance visual novel that follows the journey of a college student navigating relationships, personal growth, and the complexities of choosing the right path. With 7 unique love interests, you\u2019ll experience deep emotional connections, but ultimately, you'll have to choose one to pursue exclusively (though cheating is an option if you prefer).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a college environment, the story revolves around two distinct clubs: a lively party club and a more refined musical club. The decision of which club to join will shape the protagonist\u2019s experience and relationships with the people around him. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542710/extras/df5d1b45e4770dc48000051df11b663f.poster.avif?t=1749430914\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542710/extras/df5d1b45e4770dc48000051df11b663f.webm?t=1749430914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542710/extras/df5d1b45e4770dc48000051df11b663f.mp4?t=1749430914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Story</strong>: Shape your character and narrative with impactful choices.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow-burn romance</strong> with 7 love interests.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Social Dynamics</strong>: Build friendships, romantic relationships, and confront tough situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices that matter</strong>: Your decisions will affect the outcome of your relationships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mature Themes</strong>: Navigate complex issues like alcohol, drugs, and sex in a college setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong>: Your decisions lead to different outcomes and character arcs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Minigames</strong>: Play through challenges, from fights to social scenarios.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find Your Perfect Match \u2013 7 Unique Love Interests!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this choice-driven college visual novel, <strong>romance is yours to shape</strong>. With <strong>seven unique love interests</strong>, each with their own personality, goals, and secrets, you have the freedom to pursue deep connections, exciting flings, or something in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542710/extras/eb91a9e60865361a8565e1d6f70ef530.avif?t=1749430914\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campus Bonds Season 1</strong>\u00a0will feature a rich collection of animated scenes and images, including over 200 animations and more than 10000 images. Other features included:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10-12 hours of play time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 collectable photos (available in the gallery menu)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 25 fully fleshed lewd scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ music tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episodes 1-5</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542710/extras/2138c60ea04cb2168d46f943735afc2f.avif?t=1749430914\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campus Bonds Season 2</strong>\u00a0and future seasons will continue the story and be available as a separate DLC.</p>",
