including over 200 animations and more than 10000 images. Other features included:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10-12 hours of play time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 collectable photos (available in the gallery menu)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 25 fully fleshed lewd scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ music tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episodes 1-5</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542710/extras/2138c60ea04cb2168d46f943735afc2f.avif?t=1749430914\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campus Bonds Season 2</strong>\u00a0and future seasons will continue the story and be available as a separate DLC.</p>",
